# Windows checkouts kept flipping working-tree files to CRLF, which breaks two things in
# this repo: the admin app's single inline script is CSP-hashed, so a CRLF copy is refused
# by the browser and the page hangs on "Checking your access...", and a CSS source test
# compares bytes it cannot match. Nothing here needs CRLF, so pin everything to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
